OL,3,GNEWSA'Our son will never be the same   
OL,4,Aafter random attack'                   
OL,6,FThe family of a 20-year-old man who    
OL,7,Fdoctors fear may never be the same     
OL,8,Fafter a violent, random assault have   
OL,9,Fappealed for witnesses to come forward.
OL,11,FAmari remains in a critical condition  
OL,12,Fin hospital weeks after he was attacked
OL,13,Fnear Sandy Lane Industrial Estate in   
OL,14,FStourport-on-Severn, Worcestershire, on
OL,15,F2 October.                             
OL,17,FDetectives said his injuries were      
OL,18,Flikely to be life-changing and that    
OL,19,Fthey did not know whether he would     
OL,20,Frecover.                               
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
